    QA tick code-factory-duckbrain-qa-2026-11-05-11-35-44, measured at origin/main
    4eb928b from a throwaway clone of the published tip (the registered checkout was
    clean, attached, parity 0/0; the clone is this lane's read-only transport).
    
    CF-242 (P4, pending) — docs/audits/cf198-section-mapping.sh builds its section
    census as `grep -oE '^say "[0-9]+\.' … | sort -nu`: DISTINCT numbers, at column 0
    only. Two spellings therefore land uncounted while the gate prints RESULT: OK:
    
