    mapping table exists to catch (two arms, one plan row). The row carries a
    one-line re-runnable probe, re-extracted from the committed board and executed
    there (at_column_headers=50 indented_headers=1 / arms_plan=49 arms_tree=49 /
    RESULT: OK / rc=0; placeholder_hits=0, mktemp_hits=1).
    
